{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:43 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:43 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:43 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/b516f2b4d661574188bb1f4610e17031/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_25.jpeg\"/><p>中環皇后大道中1號匯豐總行大廈，今（16日）早上11時39分，銀行職員報案指，有四名人士到來報稱開戶口，惟其遞交的文件懷疑是偽造的，警員接報到場，經調查後拘捕4人涉使用虛假文書，其中一人為中國籍女子，另外三人為菲律賓籍人士。</p><img alt=\"四人到中環皇后大道中1號匯豐總行大廈疑出示假文件開戶口。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8b1a8268a2fac383aeffe08c15008599/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d56cdbd8aecafcc87609f7fb69b74514/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_25_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"四人到中環皇后大道中1號匯豐總行大廈開戶口，疑出示假文件。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b61cd6a805a1683cdd98e25f67307673/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f09fb124566e75729dd2da6c56308ac3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_24_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/689afd00d2ca7d68860ab30e7e891fe3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-16_at_13_18_24.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T07:00:17.804491+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:43:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T09:38:05.784752+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T06:57:44.823539+00:00","content_hash":"1420bfc89051b8a0f44fd24de6ef679f3eb6cb722f9fc374c1de3817d0b5e68a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}